  '****** Sachin 3.3.0 [DmHld and Dsg Excl check purposely ignored while copy from inv in QT as per poonam, but will be applied in history copy]
  ' ***** Manali Trading Module - 19/02/10 - DsgExc Check skipped for OmCmCtg='S'
